.* PROGRAM: the task menu for the programmer's tasks.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='PROGRAM'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=PROGRAM HELP=HLPPROGRAM KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Programming
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD STRPGMMNU'.Programmer menu
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD STRPDM'.Programming Development Manager (PDM)
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU UTILITIES'.Utilities
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?STRDBG'.Programming language debug
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU CMDSQL'.Structured Query Language (SQL) pre-compiler
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ASKQST'.Question and answer
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?STRCPYSCN'.Copy screen image
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD STRCSP'.Cross System Product/Application Execution (CSP/AE)
:MENUI OPTION=50 ACTION='MENU PROGRAMS36'.System/36 programming
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDPGM'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPPROGRAM.Programming - Help
:P.Tools for writing, building and debugging programs. Option 4 prompts the
debugger's start command; option 70 lists the program commands.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
